# 🚀 Phase 1: Plant Modeling & Control Simulation

> **Project Milestone:** MATLAB/Simulink Closed-Loop DC Motor Speed Control & System Plant Modeling.



## 📌 Overview
This repository documents **Phase 1** of my embedded systems engineering workflow. Before deploying motor control algorithms directly to hardware, I built and simulated a physical plant model in **MATLAB/Simulink** to analyze system dynamics, tune control parameters, and verify step responses.



## 🛠️ Tech Stack & Environment
* **Platform:** MATLAB / Simulink
* **Toolboxes:** Simscape (Electrical & Mechanical Domains)
* **Core Components:** 
  * Controlled Voltage Source
  * DC Motor (Armature & Rotational Housing)
  * Ideal Rotational Motion Sensor
  * PID Controller & System Solvers

