## 🎯 Next Steps (Phase 2)
* Transition from pure mathematical/physical plant simulation to microcontroller-based execution.
* Implement embedded C-code structures modeled after STM32 timer PWM outputs and ADC feedback loops.
* Simulate the complete control loop virtually using hardware platforms (such as Wokwi).
